      "id": "packages/server/src/connection.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "connection.ts",
      "language": "typescript",
      "summary": "定义传输无关的字节流连接抽象：ByteConnection（有序字节连接接口）、ByteConnectionHandler（数据/关闭/错误回调）、ByteConnectionAcceptor（连接接收工厂）、ConnectionStage（连接阶段状态机：awaitingHello→handshaking→ready→closing→closed）和 ConnectionState（单个连接的完整运行时状态，包含 id、decoder、sessionIds、握手进度等）。提供 isTerminalConnection 谓词判断连接是否已终止。",
      "lineRange": [1, 36]
    },
    {
      "id": "packages/server/src/errors.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "errors.ts",
      "language": "typescript",
      "summary": "定义可跨协议边界传递的服务器错误层级。PiServerError 是基类，携带 ProtocolErrorCode（busy/session_locked/not_found/invalid_request/not_implemented）和可选 details。派生类：SessionBusyError、SessionLockedError、SessionNotFoundError、NotImplementedError。InternalServerError 用于不可序列化的内部失败，仅保留 cause 供上报。",
      "lineRange": [1, 58]
    },
    {
