      "label": "snapshots.ts",
      "language": "typescript",
      "summary": "ServerSnapshotPublisher 类——负责组装并广播 ServerSnapshot 给所有 ready 连接。维护 revision 计数器，broadcast 方法通过队列串行化广播请求，performBroadcast 过滤 ready 连接后向每个连接发送 server_snapshot 事件。",
      "lineRange": [1, 62]
    },
